; The Delta customer's admitted expression depth: Delta grammar bounds
; parse_depth at 1,024, so a direct-recursion checker suspends about one live
; call per level. The selected evaluator's 256-context bound refuses this
; depth with status 3; it is the gap an evaluator-owned explicit stack would
; have to close.
(def descend ((n Int)) Int
  (if (eq n 0) 1 (+ 0 (descend (- n 1)))))

(def main () Int (descend 1024))
